; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/tyo7myT7xW9KphDszC5of85l1XkTCMxNioQH2JPiJXwe8V6TR2zw5jG7MZHiRObWCeu_tSSS1EIXOl7UJCYh653e1EmcNaBJXtX8Bp9uWPXK9zwBYIiOt9o1nV_6J38j5fkV64dt8K0hAnlRiWdDMJusorg7ATL0wrtd6awYfeE7z4wTuNT0x8938WShxkZRBlrWAiUld_Apf0XN-CHJjEmBNJQINZEYt3-YYngZXtgE-UvRzIxzooPP4XHAvGu8ZubffppHl4YkhWiuxNk7_vrSoRgYKVGjHwXMrrW9kHs9xQNMjANVX4qLZcj3J_Hd6brc_BbLdPMEb682gsDLHCP6ztowJ3Ok1O1faRRPj0rlpSDEpw68uToQsB1wlIMnOCaCHAlMU5U93lGvZAAnjA9kSMGekLQRafimlXeBc0XcxAw_QUKuUDShqU1XxQzrrfpYPT-r-wmVRSUfuFDDqt8IirkAwg1boadXaQtQI_eMx6U/qMYa9Fvbwhw4EQ50urTyvbK7k4teEmgY/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="阿兹曼·乌斯马尼 |布隆伯格"&gt;阿兹曼·乌斯马尼&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;总理纳伦德拉·莫迪表示，印度的&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/_uk6uIxrnY-5_fIpFPOgY5a8wslc--J7s5lz2SdYvd2VyX6eODF4jWQGdl8Tj_xtocc6iXMYT-vCYnAIKelUU4qqrwJ99EQhcUHZaPPaSpqTa6bMbJRqgJ1dRhHfD2yOeBP3hQ6R9rQCeV4fYdNdnhYc_KdH80qeECtDL9kExNxcJhNgnfGg7fbvM9sCjwx_o2dsd-odOJ8eW5Iq3wpN62moBAf-4egBKEEbjdUUm7SPekNoIGkHhAC5FY5tsn5cSG9dz61LfI3snk0xcYOyjcsVR-m1ai_EFd5eIRhoVs-jf5OFDBbQoAia36i58j2L3LfDk0M9RoL-tzJTJZ_5hXwV0jTe2Adfq929nUIqCCxbCU2B0mptcFzRDdKQO72lVxvjusWG4O858CfQY3vRJIPRgW0SUAzxyL74ZZSVOzSD0nyEuvAz7BDiC0qeh7AspToeNOn4SSfYUAyGOS8wcl_DLLkDT8Z_1-jZkY1KfqxTklU8A0JrD84AQtPfCUDxBCnbN96wS6iHX7PhieuUbe1j3ikwHGmNgRPlIJoV_CQ2SrGsOCnewSfdyqc/Y-I912b2NrqXLRI5Cr1_3DRtluuzjePG/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="可再生能源在印度电力结构中的份额创下历史新高，而煤炭则趋于平淡"&gt;可再生能源发电能力&lt;/a&gt;在过去十年中翻了两番，达到约 300 吉瓦，远远超出了《巴黎协定》下的自愿承诺。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;莫迪周二在新德里举行的&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/uyzlqp0LezmRJdf7i-NSAdnKI1Y2qn93O-iPk8wGfqsEsD_99v9Ciow6YYPMAyZuWiRlV0qM155SNpKPfYKloUMshUsJD_8jBYT_1vFu_nWT6WYJIFsl2AWvrR2qpd_6xHiCRvKoNUD4tK3Vi6GFWA2AspjEuAlktmh_f3JDXExiGVL2PC8P-esX_2mm9YEGmXYrlKebUtDThmUMHVvinOLe