ic;"&gt;摄影师：休·金塞拉·坎宁安/盖蒂图片社&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;英国政府试图淡化&lt;/strong&gt;安迪·伯纳姆关于俄罗斯干预英国脱欧投票的说法，此前英国首相与欧盟建立更密切关系的计划可能会引发激烈辩论。官员们&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/QmgjWUwcd9tpJUjmfNxKPOz1MgiVxlulmWb8KTLkj1nhAp7KkrBNo7fyEL5kTECT_8qTmRSqnAbGk9TqvJjXkgLJyDMiQX10CcwT6rqKoxtCO4xfz-IydTRqQrEBWPwYTUh5ggt1oMAvTohJHRm8YbcBweeShzBoNbrt3vLeNEM13UXEN_BFnrmQh3fvwWkVl6gvSfNjBFW_SrOtFiYEZRUl--LN5a1ZzX-EBViNC73tCfHFOKICcfe3J5qngA_qr8SLhNraLoF20phGKRJvD7AeeRHM3RPtuaz-CDqQdVi46b3Bq71XAL5tJGbM9bVaVYdcmIplWCFgFrSBOyybEK6rPXGnEJQ9R8w7JU-VmxD5BHthnY9JkIH24O_zEHL_2vbOLaByOJIROuPbFcPe7K1kdX_r7sq21YazMzMRvdn7ywhmPbtU_Y1kjz7f-3PLROn-pruonqp9VTx2usGoHS9sJv5Ri_BlXnrCmg9o-_fhg-JnBGWLP4ZAysR8bvJYngUBsqZVIWIMxiBObbw03vLLuCxpq082D9PHBEFVZv07/fXb4WHlNqBfBGheKiwm_8PqtXyaJ3GFz/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="伯纳姆在欧盟峰会前加剧了有关俄罗斯脱欧角色的争议"&gt;正忙着将这一声明与官方立场进行调和&lt;/a&gt;，即没有证据表明克里姆林宫十年前成功干预了公投。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;新德里当局&lt;/strong&gt;宣布计划将&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/fa0ndty0-0PBl6S58Z8yEOqoE734tntt42MVI5_7vijywrtLCNeD1zjSenE1gscs1KQhSLgj4hmC5kKEtRBUqv0lBSSe5cKf49weJUFSOCU9tENeYcYvVvubKp07xob9CaeKJ8M2E0E2UJLrazM67BFsXHbket8yGGKczVdB2c9Ub7VcbZ0U19raR74ZBzqdV9RGHEc9pDF7dO541tlqGkKUaN2rbulen8qOH6k8IGYXzMhlGpjTdUFwA86x5Z6t5NjdrHlJCo4OytgtwFgdUOxhBLqVL-yeYJLahpiXRSN2sqbMRPY_IripGXfnfLdZbD_E2bK85YV9DvPxEA50hI1nQ40yFOwGFx_AQ2Z8w0B_e80j-xmylM6c1qD2C1XSZtbjFsZxiH6gXWWkn1wk7CnATTOSCTc5APbpP9aAg1Zf6nwNtY3piY8ySyCMFdpyAQEwS58WkGAy0H2pUvRLIyENgLCR3ny756l85yUjF4iOn5GXG6-ck2EcnRHV0wiKliozn_A97gg2TloiJdSL8RfCJ5Ut4uZ9PVgLNtU8-b4IW2aXiznbYQ/_Qp_HUoHNL5nrphgWu73-1Y6k3RWs6Zr/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="随着选民愤怒的加剧，德里搬迁了历史性的抗议地点"&gt;抗​​议活动从首都主要示威地点简塔·曼塔天文台转移&lt;/a&gt;，此举引起了因印度备受争议的选民名册改革而连续三